1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,085
The rollout metrics around her told the same story from the business side.

2
00:00:04,085 --> 00:00:11,623
Pre-registration for the debut had become, per Y-G's own releases, the largest in the channel's history for a rookie act.

3
00:00:11,623 --> 00:00:19,690
Brand anticipation indexes ranked a group that had performed zero official songs inside the top tier of upcoming launches.

4
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:31,984
This is the part of K-pop outsiders consistently underestimate: by the time a group debuts, the market has already spent months pricing it — and the market had priced this one as the biggest launch of the year.

